{"seq":3,"slug":"realtime-stream-processing","title":"实时流处理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/big-data-platforms/realtime-stream-processing","wordCount":919,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"实时流处理\">实时流处理</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>实时流处理解决的核心问题是：如何对持续到达的无界数据流进行低延迟计算。随着业务对时效性要求从&quot;T+1 天&quot;缩短到&quot;秒级&quot;，实时流处理已成为大数据岗位的核心必备技能。2026 年的流处理技术栈以 Kafka + Flink 为主导。</p>\n<h3 id=\"kafka-消息队列\">Kafka 消息队列</h3><p>Apache Kafka 是分布式流数据平台，充当数据生产者与消费者之间的高吞吐缓冲层：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    P1[&quot;生产者 App&quot;] --&gt; T[&quot;Topic: user_events&lt;br/&gt;Partition 0 | Partition 1 | Partition 2&quot;]&#10;    P2[&quot;生产者 Web&quot;] --&gt; T&#10;    T --&gt; CG1[&quot;消费者组 A&lt;br/&gt;Flink 实时计算&quot;]&#10;    T --&gt; CG2[&quot;消费者组 B&lt;br/&gt;Spark 离线分析&quot;]\">graph LR\n    P1[\"生产者 App\"] --&gt; T[\"Topic: user_events&lt;br/&gt;Partition 0 | Partition 1 | Partition 2\"]\n    P2[\"生产者 Web\"] --&gt; T\n    T --&gt; CG1[\"消费者组 A&lt;br/&gt;Flink 实时计算\"]\n    T --&gt; CG2[\"消费者组 B&lt;br/&gt;Spark 离线分析\"]</pre><p>核心概念与配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"properties\" data-code=\"# Kafka Producer 配置&#10;bootstrap.servers=kafka1:9092,kafka2:9092,kafka3:9092&#10;acks=all                          # 所有 ISR 副本确认才算成功&#10;compression.type=lz4              # 压缩减少网络 IO&#10;batch.size=65536                  # 批量发送提升吞吐&#10;linger.ms=5                       # 等待 5ms 凑批&#10;&#10;# Topic 设计原则&#10;# - 分区数 = 消费者并行度上限&#10;# - 副本因子 &gt;= 3 保证高可用&#10;# - 保留时间根据重放需求设定（通常 7 天）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Kafka Producer 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>bootstrap.servers=kafka1:9092,kafka2:9092,kafka3:9092</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>acks=all                          # 所有 ISR 副本确认才算成功</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>compression.type=lz4              # 压缩减少网络 IO</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>batch.size=65536                  # 批量发送提升吞吐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>linger.ms=5                       # 等待 5ms 凑批</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Topic 设计原则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># - 分区数 = 消费者并行度上限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># - 副本因子 >= 3 保证高可用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># - 保留时间根据重放需求设定（通常 7 天）</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# Python Kafka 生产者&#10;from confluent_kafka import Producer&#10;import json&#10;&#10;producer = Producer({&#39;bootstrap.servers&#39;: &#39;kafka:9092&#39;})&#10;&#10;def send_event(user_id, event_type, properties):&#10;    message = json.dumps({&#10;        &#39;user_id&#39;: user_id,&#10;        &#39;event&#39;: event_type,&#10;        &#39;properties&#39;: properties,&#10;        &#39;timestamp&#39;: int(time.time() * 1000)&#10;    })&#10;    producer.produce(&#10;        topic=&#39;user_events&#39;,&#10;        key=user_id,          # 相同 user 路由到同一分区，保证顺序&#10;        value=message&#10;    )&#10;    producer.flush()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Python Kafka 生产者</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> confluent_kafka </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Producer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">producer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Producer({</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bootstrap.servers'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'kafka:9092'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> send_event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user_id, event_type, properties):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    message </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json.dumps({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'user_id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'event'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: event_type,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'properties'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: properties,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'timestamp'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(time.time() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    producer.produce(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        topic</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user_events'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user_id,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 相同 user 路由到同一分区，保证顺序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">message</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    producer.flush()</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"flink-流计算框架\">Flink 流计算框架</h3><p>Apache Flink 是当前最成熟的分布式流处理引擎，以&quot;事件时间处理&quot;和&quot;精确一次语义&quot;为核心优势：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// Flink Java API：实时订单金额统计&#10;StreamExecutionEnvironment env = StreamExecutionEnvironment.getExecutionEnvironment();&#10;env.setParallelism(4);&#10;&#10;DataStream&lt;String&gt; source = env.addSource(&#10;    new FlinkKafkaConsumer&lt;&gt;(&quot;orders&quot;, new SimpleStringSchema(), kafkaProps)&#10;);&#10;&#10;DataStream&lt;OrderEvent&gt; orders = source&#10;    .map(json -&gt; parseOrder(json))&#10;    .assignTimestampsAndWatermarks(&#10;        WatermarkStrategy.&lt;OrderEvent&gt;forBoundedOutOfOrderness(Duration.ofSeconds(5))&#10;            .withTimestampAssigner((event, ts) -&gt; event.getEventTime())&#10;    );&#10;&#10;// 5 分钟滚动窗口统计&#10;DataStream&lt;WindowResult&gt; result = orders&#10;    .keyBy(OrderEvent::getCategory)&#10;    .window(TumblingEventTimeWindows.of(Time.minutes(5)))&#10;    .aggregate(new OrderAggregator(), new WindowResultFunction());&#10;&#10;result.addSink(new FlinkKafkaProducer&lt;&gt;(&quot;order_stats&quot;, ...));&#10;env.execute(&quot;Real-time Order Stats&quot;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Flink Java API：实时订单金额统计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">StreamExecutionEnvironment env </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StreamExecutionEnvironment.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getExecutionEnvironment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">env.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setParallelism</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DataStream&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> source </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> env.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addSource</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FlinkKafkaConsumer&#x3C;>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SimpleStringSchema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), kafkaProps)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DataStream&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OrderEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(json </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(json))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">assignTimestampsAndWatermarks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        WatermarkStrategy.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">OrderEvent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forBoundedOutOfOrderness</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Duration.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ofSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">withTimestampAssigner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((event, ts) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEventTime</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 5 分钟滚动窗口统计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DataStream&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WindowResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">keyBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(OrderEvent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">getCategory)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">window</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(TumblingEventTimeWindows.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">minutes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">aggregate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderAggregator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WindowResultFunction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addSink</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FlinkKafkaProducer&#x3C;>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order_stats\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ...));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">env.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Real-time Order Stats\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Flink 的 Python API（PyFlink）在 2026 年已相当成熟：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from pyflink.datastream import StreamExecutionEnvironment&#10;from pyflink.table import StreamTableEnvironment&#10;&#10;env = StreamExecutionEnvironment.get_execution_environment()&#10;t_env = StreamTableEnvironment.create(env)&#10;&#10;# SQL 方式定义流处理&#10;t_env.execute_sql(&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    CREATE TABLE user_events (&#10;        user_id STRING,&#10;        event_type STRING,&#10;        event_time TIMESTAMP(3),&#10;        WATERMARK FOR event_time AS event_time - INTERVAL &#39;5&#39; SECOND&#10;    ) WITH (&#10;        &#39;connector&#39; = &#39;kafka&#39;,&#10;        &#39;topic&#39; = &#39;user_events&#39;,&#10;        &#39;properties.bootstrap.servers&#39; = &#39;kafka:9092&#39;,&#10;        &#39;format&#39; = &#39;json&#39;&#10;    )&#10;&quot;&quot;&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 实时 PV/UV 统计&#10;t_env.execute_sql(&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    SELECT&#10;        TUMBLE_START(event_time, INTERVAL &#39;1&#39; MINUTE) AS window_start,&#10;        event_type,&#10;        COUNT(*) AS pv,&#10;        COUNT(DISTINCT user_id) AS uv&#10;    FROM user_events&#10;    GROUP BY TUMBLE(event_time, INTERVAL &#39;1&#39; MINUTE), event_type&#10;&quot;&quot;&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pyflink.datastream </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StreamExecutionEnvironment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pyflink.table </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StreamTableEnvironment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">env </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StreamExecutionEnvironment.get_execution_environment()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">t_env </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StreamTableEnvironment.create(env)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># SQL 方式定义流处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">t_env.execute_sql(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    CREATE TABLE user_events (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        user_id STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        event_type STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        event_time TIMESTAMP(3),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WATERMARK FOR event_time AS event_time - INTERVAL '5' SECOND</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ) WITH (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'connector' = 'kafka',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'topic' = 'user_events',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'properties.bootstrap.servers' = 'kafka:9092',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'format' = 'json'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 实时 PV/UV 统计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">t_env.execute_sql(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        TUMBLE_START(event_time, INTERVAL '1' MINUTE) AS window_start,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        event_type,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        COUNT(*) AS pv,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        COUNT(DISTINCT user_id) AS uv</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM user_events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    GROUP BY TUMBLE(event_time, INTERVAL '1' MINUTE), event_type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"窗口函数设计\">窗口函数设计</h3><p>窗口是流处理的核心抽象，将无界流切分为有界计算片段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>窗口类型</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>滚动窗口（Tumbling）</td>\n<td>固定大小，不重叠</td>\n<td>每分钟 PV 统计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动窗口（Sliding）</td>\n<td>固定大小，可重叠</td>\n<td>最近 5 分钟均值，每 1 分钟更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话窗口（Session）</td>\n<td>按活动间隔动态划分</td>\n<td>用户会话分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局窗口（Global）</td>\n<td>需自定义 Trigger</td>\n<td>自定义聚合逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>窗口大小的选择涉及延迟与精度的权衡：窗口越小延迟越低但统计波动越大，窗口越大结果越稳定但延迟越高。</p>\n<h3 id=\"状态管理\">状态管理</h3><p>有状态的流处理是 Flink 区别于简单消息处理的核心能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 实时去重：利用 ValueState 记录已见用户&#10;public class DeduplicateFunction extends KeyedProcessFunction&lt;String, Event, Event&gt; {&#10;    private ValueState&lt;Boolean&gt; seenState;&#10;&#10;    @Override&#10;    public void open(Configuration params) {&#10;        seenState = getRuntimeContext().getState(&#10;            new ValueStateDescriptor&lt;&gt;(&quot;seen&quot;, Boolean.class)&#10;        );&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Override&#10;    public void processElement(Event event, Context ctx, Collector&lt;Event&gt; out) throws Exception {&#10;        if (seenState.value() == null) {&#10;            seenState.update(true);&#10;            out.collect(event);&#10;            // 24 小时后清除状态&#10;            ctx.timerService().registerEventTimeTimer(&#10;                ctx.timestamp() + 24 * 3600 * 1000L&#10;            );&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Override&#10;    public void onTimer(long timestamp, OnTimerContext ctx, Collector&lt;Event&gt; out) {&#10;        seenState.clear();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 实时去重：利用 ValueState 记录已见用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DeduplicateFunction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color