ueStateDescriptor&#x3C;>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"seen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Boolean.class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Event </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Context </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Collector&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">out</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throws</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Exception {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (seenState.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            seenState.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            out.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">collect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // 24 小时后清除状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">timerService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">registerEventTimeTimer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 24</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3600</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000L</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onTimer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">long</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, OnTimerContext </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Collector&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">out</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        seenState.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">clear</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Flink 的状态后端（State Backend）决定了状态的存储位置：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>HashMapStateBackend</strong>：状态存内存，速度快，容量受限于 JVM 堆</li>\n<li><strong>EmbeddedRocksDBStateBackend</strong>：状态存本地磁盘（RocksDB），支持超大状态</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"exactly-once-语义\">Exactly-Once 语义</h3><p>精确一次（Exactly-Once）是流处理最强的一致性保证，意味着即使发生故障，每条数据也只被处理一次：</p>\n<p>Flink 通过 <strong>Checkpoint</strong> 机制实现 Exactly-Once：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>JobManager 定期向所有 Source 注入 Barrier（屏障）</li>\n<li>各 Operator 收到 Barrier 后将本地状态快照到持久存储</li>\n<li>所有 Operator 完成快照后，该 Checkpoint 标记为 Completed</li>\n<li>故障恢复时从最近 Completed Checkpoint 恢复状态</li>\n</ol>\n<p>端到端 Exactly-Once 还需要 Sink 端支持事务（如 Kafka 事务、两阶段提交）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Flink 2.x 统一批流</strong>：消除批处理和流处理的 API 差异，一套代码同时支持两种模式</li>\n<li><strong>Kafka 去 ZooKeeper</strong>：KRaft 模式简化运维，Kafka 4.0 完全移除 ZooKeeper 依赖</li>\n<li><strong>流式数据湖</strong>：Paimon（原 Flink Table Store）实现流式写入 + 实时查询的湖仓一体</li>\n<li><strong>LLM 实时推理</strong>：将 LLM 嵌入 Flink 算子，对流数据进行实时文本分析和内容审核</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>搭建本地 Kafka 环境，创建一个 Topic 并用 Python 生产者模拟发送用户点击事件流</li>\n<li>用 PyFlink SQL 实现一个 1 分钟滚动窗口的实时 UV 统计，结果写入 Kafka 另一个 Topic</li>\n<li>设计一个实时反欺诈场景：5 分钟内同一用户登录超过 3 个不同城市则触发告警</li>\n<li>思考：Exactly-Once 语义的代价是什么？在什么场景下 At-Least-Once 就够用了？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>实时流处理技术栈以 Kafka（数据总线）+ Flink（计算引擎）为核心。Kafka 提供高吞吐、持久化的消息队列能力，Flink 提供事件时间处理、精确状态管理和多种窗口语义。掌握窗口设计、状态管理和 Exactly-Once 机制，你将具备构建企业级实时数据管道的核心能力——这也是 2026 年大数据岗位薪资溢价最高的技能方向。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"实时流处理","id":"实时流处理"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"Kafka 消息队列","id":"kafka-消息队列"},{"level":3,"text":"Flink 流计算框架","id":"flink-流计算框架"},{"level":3,"text":"窗口函数设计","id":"窗口函数设计"},{"level":3,"text":"状态管理","id":"状态管理"},{"level":3,"text":"Exactly-Once 语义","id":"exactly-once-语义"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Spark 计算引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/big-data-platforms/spark-computing"},"next":{"title":"统计分析方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/data-analysis-visualization/statistical-analysis"}}